# vsock-only.fragment: applied after lean.fragment when VSOCK_ONLY=1.
# The guest's only channel out is AF_VSOCK to the host proxy (CID 2). No IP at all.
# Tools must open vsock themselves, or go through an AF_UNIX -> vsock shim in the guest
# (socat UNIX-LISTEN:/run/egress.sock,fork VSOCK-CONNECT:2:8080). A loopback TCP shim
# needs CONFIG_INET and does not work with this profile.
# Costs: the tap mode in HOWTO §7 (NET=1) is gone, and guest software that creates an
# AF_INET socket gets EAFNOSUPPORT.

# No TCP/IP: no TCP, UDP, ICMP, routing or IPv4 sockets in the guest kernel.
# CONFIG_INET is not set

# No NIC driver, and no raw packet sockets (AF_PACKET has its own LPE history) with nothing to send on.
# CONFIG_VIRTIO_NET is not set
# CONFIG_PACKET is not set

# What stays: the socket layer, Unix sockets and vsock.
CONFIG_NET=y
CONFIG_UNIX=y
CONFIG_VSOCKETS=y
CONFIG_VIRTIO_VSOCKETS=y
